@startuml TBOT-ParentGate
title Domain · parent-gate — shared speed-bump service
left to right direction

actor Child
actor Parent

package "parent-gate" <<service>> {
  usecase "Pass Parent Gate (3-digit)"  as UC_PG_PASS
  usecase "Confirm Activation (4-digit)" as UC_PG_UNLOCK
}

Child  --> UC_PG_PASS    : initiate
Parent --> UC_PG_PASS    : complete
Parent --> UC_PG_UNLOCK

note bottom of UC_PG_PASS
  Used by: kid-hub (Enter Parent Space),
  parent-summary, course-library, robot-mgmt.
  Speed bump only — NOT real RBAC.
  (ParentGatePage random 3-digit match)
end note

note bottom of UC_PG_UNLOCK
  Used by: purchase (Activate Robot via code).
  Course assignment uses UC_CL_CONFIRM_ADD instead.
end note

' Files:
'   src/features/parent/ParentGatePage.jsx
'   src/features/purchase/screens/ActivateScreen.tsx
@enduml
